      <div class="hero-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6" stroke="#F21B2D" stroke-width="1.5"/><polygon points="5.5,4.5 10,7 5.5,9.5" fill="#F21B2D"/></svg>
        YouTube-Certified Expert · 123M+ Views
      </div>
      <h1>YouTube Consulting &amp; Channel Management for YouTubers</h1>
      <p>Grow your YouTube channel with Creator Essentials.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/services/youtube-channel-audit/" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Channel Audit</a>
        <a href="/services/youtube-coaching-program/" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore Coaching</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROOF BAR -->
<section class="bg-cloud" style="padding-block:2.5rem;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="proof-bar" style="justify-content:space-around;">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>123M+</strong>
        <span>Total Views</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>300K+</strong>
        <span>Subscribers Grown</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>YouTube</strong>
        <span>Certified Expert</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>$89/mo</strong>
        <span>Coaching Program</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Creator Essentials Services</span>
      <h2>What Creator Essentials does for you</h2>
      <p>Each offer has a specific job. Pick the one that fits where you are right now.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">

      <div class="card card-red">
        <div class="card-number">1</div>
        <h3>1-on-1 YouTube Consulting</h3>
        <p>1-on-1 YouTube consulting is one of the most effective strategies for growing your channel and becoming more intentional. Whether it's increasing views and subscribers or improving YouTube SEO techniques, consulting helps you make well-informed decisions about how to progress your channel in a strategic way.</p>
        <a href="/services/youtube-consulting/" class="card-cta">
          Book a Session
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-number">2</div>
        <h3>YouTube Coaching &amp; Mentoring</h3>
        <p>Struggling to grow your YouTube channel? With Personal YouTube Coaching &amp; Mentoring, you'll get 1-on-1 expert guidance, a customized growth strategy, and real feedback to help you gain more views, subscribers, and revenue — all for just $89/month with a 7-day free trial.</p>
        <a href="/services/youtube-coaching-program/" class="card-cta">
          Start Free Trial
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-number">3</div>
        <h3>YouTube Channel Management</h3>
        <p>YouTube Channel Managers can be an invaluable asset to your channel. As a channel manager, I take on many of the responsibilities associated with managing a YouTube channel — SEO, thumbnail creation, content ideation, video editing, community posts &amp; more — and I work at improving your overall ROI.</p>
        <a href="/services/youtube-channel-management/" class="card-cta">
          Learn More
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-number">4</div>
        <h3>Additional Products &amp; One-Time Services</h3>
        <p>Whether you need an extensive channel audit to uncover growth opportunities, competitor analysis to refine your strategy, or a fully optimized channel setup, these one-time services provide clear, actionable recommendations to help you succeed.</p>
        <a href="/products/" class="card-cta">
          More Products
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT / ROB -->
<section class="bg-cloud">
  <div class="container" style="display:grid; gap:3rem; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About Creator Essentials</span>
      <h2>Hi there! My name is Rob.</h2>
      <p>I'm the founder of Creator Essentials. As a former full-time content creator myself, I get what it's like to be directionless, scared of getting on camera, and to be stuck in "analysis paralysis".</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">Now years later, I know what it takes to create with purpose, believe in yourself, get found online, and make tons of money doing what you love. I have grown my own YouTube channels and those of clients I have worked with to over 123 million views, 300,000 subscribers, and countless product sales.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">My goal is to help you grow your influence online through YouTube and crush through all of the emotional obstacles that are associated with creating on social media. By working with me, you'll draw on years of SEO and YouTube experience.</p>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">More About Me</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="card" style="background:var(--charcoal); border-color:transparent;">
        <blockquote style="color:var(--white); font-size:1.1rem; font-family:var(--font-head); line-height:1.4; margin-bottom:1rem;">"Creator growth without the guesswork."</blockquote>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size:0.875rem; margin:0;">Channels worked with: @LaserAway · @DanHenry · @premiermarbleracing</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

